    <section class="section-faq">
      <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
        <div class="faq-wrapper">
          <div class="left_side-faq">
            <div class="header-faq">
              <div class="text_heading-faq">
                <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                <div class="max-w-400">
                  <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span-pink-2">Got questions?<br>‍</span>We&#x27;ve got answers</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
            </div><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
          </div>
          <div class="right_side-faq">
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3847" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">What are your working hour for US clients</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a384b" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We are a global team with flexible working hours, allowing us to ensure seamless communication and collaboration with our US-based clients, no matter the time zone.</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3850" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">Do you understand the niche trends for US-based businesses?</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3854" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, 70% of our clientele is US-based, and we frequently partner with Y Combinator companies in San Francisco. This gives us a deep understanding of the trends and needs specific to US businesses, especially in the tech, AI and B2B</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3859" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">How long does production take?</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a385d" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">A standard explainer video runs 2–4 weeks from kickoff to delivery. Rush timelines are available depending on scope. Our async collaboration model means you&#x27;re never waiting around for a meeting  feedback happens on your schedule, not ours, using Loom and Frame.io for asynchronous reviews.</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3862" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">How many revisions do we get?</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a3866" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We build revision rounds into every project stage  script, storyboard, animation, and final. You&#x27;ll never hit a wall mid project. Our goal is to get it right, not to run out the clock on your revision credits. Scope changes are discussed openly, upfront.</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a386b" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">Can I see a sample before committing?</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="07f0309f-1c40-ffd9-5706-67a9da8a386f" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">es — and it&#x27;s genuinely free, not a bait-and-switch. Before any contract or payment, we&#x27;ll create a custom storyboard or short video sample tailored to your product. It&#x27;s how we prove the fit, not just describe it</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="70dfc388-063d-bbb1-1c82-7e5a5f927b74" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
              <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                <p class="text-14-150">What does the onboarding process look like?</p>
                <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="70dfc388-063d-bbb1-1c82-7e5a5f927b78" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
              </div>
              <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                  <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">It starts with a 30-min discovery call (or async brief if you prefer). From there: kickoff → script → storyboard approval → animation → final delivery. Every step has a clear owner, a timeline, and a feedback window. No back-and-forth chaos, no missing deliverables.</p>
                </div>
              </nav>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
